  "version": "as-filed",
  "operative_text": "Sec. 1 (amending 18 Pa.C.S. 6109(h)(1)): [In] Except as provided for in paragraph (8), in addition to fees described in [paragraphs (2)(ii) and] paragraph (3), the fee for a license to carry a firearm is $19.\nSec. 1 (adding 18 Pa.C.S. 6109(h)(8)): The governing authority of a county may, after consultation with the sheriff or, in a city of the first class, the chief of police, waive the fees provided for in paragraphs (1) and (3) for an applicant who is an honorably discharged veteran of the armed forces of the United States or is 65 years of age or older.",
